        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Bulawayo Railway Museum, Bulawayo railway station, Zimbabwe, Rhodesia, South Africa\n- People: Cecil Rhodes\n- Topics: railway museums, railway exhibits\n\nFacts:\n- Bulawayo Railway Museum is a railway museum located at Bulawayo railway station in Zimbabwe, formerly Rhodesia.\n- The oldest exhibits at Bulawayo Railway Museum date back to 1897.\n- The exhibits at Bulawayo Railway Museum include the personal railway coach of Cecil Rhodes.\n- Cecil Rhodes was a British businessman, mining magnate, and politician in South Africa.\n- Cecil Rhodes is now mainly known as a racist colonialist.",
